QuestGuidance.Register("en",341,{
[10881]="7006EB8B\n1\tMeet with Razâl outside of Esh-kimâkhi\tMeet with Razâl, Mizâdi's scout, outside of Esh-kimâkhi. The Crypts of Esh-kimâkhi can be found south-east of Urmâkh.\n2\tSearch the Crypts of Esh-kimâkhi south of Urmâkh for signs of Mizâdi's missing husband, Eshtali. Mizâdi said he would be wearing crimson robes.\t\n3\tContinue searching around Esh-kimâkhi - Eshtali may be close\tContinue searching the Crypts of Esh-kimâkhi south of Urmâkh for signs of Mizâdi's missing husband, Eshtali.\n4\tExamine the man to determine if he is Eshtali\tExamine the man to determine if he is Eshtali.\n5\tSpeak with Razâl at the edge of Esh-kimâkhi\tSpeak with Razâl at the edge of Esh-kimâkhi.\n6\tBring Mizâdi in Urmâkh her husband's effects, and news of his death\tGive Mizâdi in Urmâkh news of her husband's death, and what you found of his possessions.\n",
[10882]="70071B7B\n1\tCollect rock-worm glands (total: 8)\tSâdikiz says he can repay his debts by selling the glands of rock-worms found at the Pools of Taridím, west of Khanâg Gur, and the Seething-wells in northern An Shêru.\n2\tBring the rock-worm glands to Sâdikiz the Sky-hungry\tYou have collected the rock-worm glands that Sâdikiz requested. You should bring them to him at Khanâg Gur.\n",
[10883]="7002BF7D\n1\tTalk to Aculf at his camp in the Rushgore\tAculf is at his camp in the Rushgore, along the road east from Parth Celebrant. Idmar asked you to offer your assistance to his friend Aculf.\n",
[10884]="70008858\n1\tReturn to First Marshal Núrdram at the Grimwood Lumber-yard\030Collect Grimwood-branches (total: 5)\tSmall branches can be found scattered on the ground and on the Leafcull-trees throughout the Grimwood. First Marshal Núrdram asked you to search along the Grimwood and Hithlad for small branches that might be turned into arrowshafts.\n",
[10885]="70058BC4\n1\tSpeak with Óli\tÓli has asked for your assistance in retaking Bagûd-mekhem.\n2\tDefeat Azbauz and Maugrush\030Defeat Shatarkha\tSecure the eastern and western gate controls\n3\tDefeat Zhurmat and Groz-and-Ulk\tDefeat Zhurmat and Groz-and-Ulk and secure the Gate of Winds\n",
[10886]="700589EB\n1\tSpeak with Óli\tÓli has asked for your assistance in retaking Bagûd-mekhem.\n2\tDefeat Azbauz and Maugrush\030Defeat Shatarkha\tSecure the eastern and western gate controls\n3\tDefeat Zhurmat and Groz-and-Ulk\tDefeat Zhurmat and Groz-and-Ulk to secure the Gate of Winds\n",
[10887]="700589EC\n1\tSpeak with Óli\tÓli has asked for your assistance in retaking Bagûd-mekhem.\n2\tDefeat Azbauz and Maugrush\030Defeat Shatarkha\tSecure the eastern and western gate controls.\n3\tDefeat Zhurmat and Groz-and-Ulk\tDefeat Zhurmat and Groz-and-Ulk to secure the Gate of Winds.\n",
[10888]="700589EF\n1\tSpeak with Óli\t\n2\tDefeat Azbauz and Maugrush\030Defeat Shatarkha\tSecure the eastern and western gate controls\n3\tDefeat Zhurmat and Groz-and-Ulk\tDefeat Zhurmat and Groz-and-Ulk to secure the Gate of Winds\n",
